{"product_id":"fruity-cereal-i-love-salts","title":"Fruit Cereal by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNom. Nom. Nom. Wow. This juice is delicious. Oh, sorry for that minor interruption. That’s what happens when you vape I Heart Salts Fruity Cereal E-Juice. It kind of takes you to another place. A spectrum of sweet and fruity cereal flavors is swept in by the taste of pure whole milk and plenty of sugar as you inhale this nicotine salt juice. Each vape of I Heart Salts Fruit Cereal tastes like slurping an overfull spoonful of your favorite crunchy fruit cereal.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFruity Cereal is part of Mad Hatter Vapes’ I Love Salts juice line, which is made up strictly of nicotine salt e-liquids. This means you’ll get a more powerful nic hit when you inhale. The I Love Salts e-juices are available in either 25 mg or 50 mg nicotine strength, so you have control over your desired nicotine level. Like all nic salts, Fruit Cereal is not to be used with sub-ohm devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet the scoop on Fruity Cereal E-Juice by buying a bottle now!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"ht